git-annex 10.20261113 released with [[!toggle text="these changes"]]
[[!toggleable text="""  * Added transfers command, displays a live view of transfers.
  * Don't prompt for verification of proxied remotes, which is not
    necessary and didn't work. (Fixes reversion in 10.20261026.)
  * p2phttp: When --directory is used to serve a large number of
    repositories, limit the amount of git helper processes and open files.
  * Fix buggy handling of a submodule in a linked git worktree.
  * Fix bug in parsing the P2P protocol that caused breakage when filenames
    contained unicode multibyte space characters.
  * Fix mimetype and mimencoding detection of non-ascii filenames
    in non-unicode locales.
  * Avoid display issues with multiple progress meters when not in a
    unicode locale.
  * Botan is enabled by default; removed build flag.
  * git-annex.cabal: Switch from magic to libmagic.
  * Allow the MAGIC environment variable to override the bundled magic file
    location.
  * The Linux arm64-ancient build has reached end of security support
    and will be removed after this release. Android users are recommended
    to switch to running `pkg install git-annex` inside termux.
  * NoLLMDependencies: Update for network and http-semantics.
  * Fix build when the Memory build flag is disabled.
  * Fix testremote failure with p2phttp remote.
    (Reversion from 10.20261005)"""]]